  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/1401\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\n_No response_\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Anything else?\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/1401 was opened for the creation of the appropriate Web IDL to be used to solve the problem, as evidenced by the concrete examples provided. Is there a solution to the showcased problem already available in WebIDL, and if not, how would Web IDL look for solving it?\r\n\r\nOnce a that person closed that issue, it didn't seem possible to be able to reopen it.",
